WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.714 --> 00:00:11.354
Typed the wrong weight, or logged a workout on the wrong day? Any past workout can be fixed in a few taps.

2
00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:12.670
Here's how.

3
00:00:13.032 --> 00:00:16.552
Open the Progress tab, and tap Workout log.

4
00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:18.996
Tap the set you got wrong.

5
00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:20.480
Fix the weight,

6
00:00:21.083 --> 00:00:22.843
and tap the Save button.

7
00:00:23.492 --> 00:00:26.292
Wrong day? Tap the date at the top.

8
00:00:26.649 --> 00:00:29.529
Pick when it really happened, and tap Save.

9
00:00:29.886 --> 00:00:33.566
Your log, charts, and records all follow the fix.
